     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I got mm10 bed file from <a href=\"http://genome.ucsc.edu/cgi-bin/hgTables?hgsid=330701821&amp;boolshad.hgta_printCustomTrackHeaders=0&amp;hgta_ctName=tb_refGene&amp;hgta_ctDesc=table+browser+query+on+refGene&amp;hgta_ctVis=pack&amp;hgta_ctUrl=&amp;fbQual=whole&amp;fbUpBases=200&amp;fbExonBases=200&amp;fbIntronBases=200&amp;fbDownBases=200&amp;hgta_doGetBed=get+BED\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://genome.ucsc.edu/cgi-bin/hgTables?hgsid%3D330701821%26boolshad.hgta_printCustomTrackHeaders%3D0%26hgta_ctName%3Dtb_refGene%26hgta_ctDesc%3Dtable%2Bbrowser%2Bquery%2Bon%2BrefGene%26hgta_ctVis%3Dpack%26hgta_ctUrl%3D%26fbQual%3Dwhole%26fbUpBases%3D200%26fbExonBases%3D200%26fbIntronBases%3D200%26fbDownBases%3D200%26hgta_doGetBed%3Dget%2BBED&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793234692886000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2q3S7d-I08CyHKuWisOEBP\">http://genome.ucsc.edu </a>. I used it in following code <br><br><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\" class=\"gmail_quote\">gene.obj &lt;- read.transcript.features(location=system.file(&quot;extdata&quot;,&quot;hgTables.bed.txt&quot;, package = &quot;methylKit&quot;))<br></blockquote><br>But got following error. When I use <a href=\"https://code.google.com/p/methylkit/downloads/detail?name=refseq.hg18.bed.txt&amp;can=2&amp;q=\" style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline;white-space:nowrap;font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://code.google.com/p/methylkit/downloads/detail?name%3Drefseq.hg18.bed.txt%26can%3D2%26q%3D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793234692886000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1UMYJ8R2JNaTeo0kJImzrn\">refseq.hg18.bed.txt</a> I do not get any error.<br><br>Error in if (grepl(&quot;^track&quot;, f.line)) (skip = 1) : <br>  argument is of length zero<br>In addition: Warning message:<br>In file(con, &quot;r&quot;) :<br>  file(&quot;&quot;) only supports open = &quot;w+&quot; and open = &quot;w+b&quot;: using the former<br><br>I appreciate your help. Thank !<br></div>"
    ]
