     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">how does the bed file look like? Make sure its format matches the example and it is indeed in bed format.<div><br></div><div>By the way, for that line of code to work, you need to put &quot;hgTables.bed.txt&quot; into the extdata folder in the package installation directory. I assume you have done that but it is not necessary, you can simply give the path to the bed file as the &quot;location&quot; argument.</div></div>"
    ],
